{"2127350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Journey Express", "steam_appid": 2127350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4037660], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Express</strong> is a hybrid 2D/3D adventure game that challenges you to get a party of travelers from their current home to a new life elsewhere. The road is fraught with dangers, and you must carefully manage food, medicine, and money so that you and your party make it there in one piece! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVEL &amp; EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While traveling a world handmade in pixel art, explore each region in 3D! Acquire food and other items by hunting, fishing, and searching for unique points of interest.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel, you'll experience dynamic time of day and weather, which influence the events you encounter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b2e7850c52762e2122136a63641d2ff5.poster.avif?t=1780759645\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b2e7850c52762e2122136a63641d2ff5.webm?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b2e7850c52762e2122136a63641d2ff5.mp4?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVEL &amp; DISCOVER NEW SIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family's name isn't what it used to be, but each of your completed journeys will contribute to your wealth and reputation.  If your character succumbs to injury or illness, you will create a new one as a successor to continue where they left off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your journal's codex by finding all locations, discoveries, and points of interest as you travel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b7f22f91687058f1ca167248a478045b.poster.avif?t=1780759645\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b7f22f91687058f1ca167248a478045b.webm?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b7f22f91687058f1ca167248a478045b.mp4?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD MAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely decide what direction you go at any time while you manage your food and supplies to safely get where you want to go. Navigate grasslands, mountains, deserts, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unique locations and discoveries scattered across the land for additional funding towards your journeys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/537bda5b42c229dd87cff4ed45887ed9.poster.avif?t=1780759645\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/537bda5b42c229dd87cff4ed45887ed9.webm?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/537bda5b42c229dd87cff4ed45887ed9.mp4?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Express</strong> is a hybrid 2D/3D adventure game that challenges you to get a party of travelers from their current home to a new life elsewhere. The road is fraught with dangers, and you must carefully manage food, medicine, and money so that you and your party make it there in one piece! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVEL &amp; EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While traveling a world handmade in pixel art, explore each region in 3D! Acquire food and other items by hunting, fishing, and searching for unique points of interest.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel, you'll experience dynamic time of day and weather, which influence the events you encounter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b2e7850c52762e2122136a63641d2ff5.poster.avif?t=1780759645\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b2e7850c52762e2122136a63641d2ff5.webm?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b2e7850c52762e2122136a63641d2ff5.mp4?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVEL &amp; DISCOVER NEW SIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family's name isn't what it used to be, but each of your completed journeys will contribute to your wealth and reputation.  If your character succumbs to injury or illness, you will create a new one as a successor to continue where they left off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your journal's codex by finding all locations, discoveries, and points of interest as you travel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b7f22f91687058f1ca167248a478045b.poster.avif?t=1780759645\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b7f22f91687058f1ca167248a478045b.webm?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/b7f22f91687058f1ca167248a478045b.mp4?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD MAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely decide what direction you go at any time while you manage your food and supplies to safely get where you want to go. Navigate grasslands, mountains, deserts, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unique locations and discoveries scattered across the land for additional funding towards your journeys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/537bda5b42c229dd87cff4ed45887ed9.poster.avif?t=1780759645\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/537bda5b42c229dd87cff4ed45887ed9.webm?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/extras/537bda5b42c229dd87cff4ed45887ed9.mp4?t=1780759645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A hybrid 2D/3D adventure game pitting the player against countless dangers on a cross-country journey. Manage your resources and keep your party alive!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/header.jpg?t=1780759645", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780759645"